---
// SupportHighlights Component - Jaminan & dukungan layanan (tanpa klaim angka)
---

<section class="support-section">
  <div class="container">
    <h2 class="section-title">Dukungan &amp; Jaminan Layanan</h2>
    <p class="section-subtitle">Yang Anda dapatkan setelah memesan — tanpa klaim yang tidak bisa kami buktikan</p>

    <div class="support-grid">
      <div class="support-card">
        <span class="support-step">01</span>
        <h3 class="support-title">Pemasangan Dibantu Langsung</h3>
        <p class="support-text">
          Perangkat lunak wajib dipasang langsung ke perangkat yang dipantau. Tim kami
          mendampingi proses pemasangan sampai aplikasi berjalan normal.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="support-card">
        <span class="support-step">02</span>
        <h3 class="support-title">Panduan Lengkap via Email</h3>
        <p class="support-text">
          Setelah konfirmasi pembayaran, software beserta panduan pemasangan dikirim
          melalui email dengan langkah-langkah yang mudah diikuti.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="support-card">
        <span class="support-step">03</span>
        <h3 class="support-title">Dukungan Teknis 24/7</h3>
        <p class="support-text">
          Kendala saat pemasangan maupun penggunaan dapat ditanyakan kapan saja
          melalui WhatsApp, email, atau panggilan telepon.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="stats-container">
      <div class="stat-item">
        <span class="stat-mark">✓</span>
        <span class="stat-label">Fitur sesuai deskripsi halaman layanan</span>
      </div>
      <div class="stat-item">
        <span class="stat-mark">✓</span>
        <span class="stat-label">Pembayaran dikonfirmasi sebelum software dikirim</span>
      </div>
      <div class="stat-item">
        <span class="stat-mark">✓</span>
        <span class="stat-label">Perpanjangan masa aktif dari dalam panel software</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .support-section {
    padding: calc(var(--grid-unit) * 8) 0;
    background: var(--color-light-gray);
  }

  :global([data-theme="dark"]) .support-section {
    background: var(--color-background);
  }

  .container {
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 var(--content-padding);
  }

  .section-title {
    font-size: 2.5rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--color-accent);
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    font-family: var(--font-heading-primary);
  }

  .section-subtitle {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
  }

  .support-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr));
    gap: 2rem;
    margin-bottom: 4rem;
  }

  .support-card {
    padding: 2rem;
    background: var(--color-surface);
    border-radius: 12px;
    border-left: 6px solid var(--color-accent);
    box-shadow: 0 4px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
  }

  [data-theme="dark"] .support-card {
    background: var(--color-surface);
    box-shadow: 0 4px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
  }

  .support-step {
    display: inline-block;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--color-accent-text);
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .support-title {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--color-text-primary);
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    font-family: var(--font-heading-secondary);
  }

  .support-text {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .stats-container {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    padding: 2rem;
    background: var(--color-light-gray);
    border-radius: 12px;
    border-top: 6px solid var(--color-accent);
  }

  [data-theme="dark"] .stats-container {
    background: var(--color-surface);
  }

  .stat-item {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 0.75rem;
  }

  .stat-mark {
    color: var(--color-accent-text);
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .stat-label {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--color-text-primary);
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .section-title {
      font-size: 1.8rem;
    }

    .support-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 1.5rem;
    }
  }
</style>
